"Main effects, all two-way interactions and the squared terms of all "
"continuous factors."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Allows manually defining the main effects and interactions in the model."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"When analysing response surface designs, the continuous factors whose "
"squared terms are included in the manually defined model."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
