msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a Pareto plot of the standardized effects. For a saturated model (no "
"error degrees of freedom) of two-level factorial terms, the plot shows the "
"absolute effects with the margin of error based on Lenth's (1989) pseudo "
"standard error; other saturated models give an error."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
"Show a normal probability plot of the standardized effects. For a saturated "
"model (no error degrees of freedom) of two-level factorial terms, the plot "
"shows the effects with a reference line based on Lenth's (1989) pseudo "
"standard error, and effects larger than its margin of error are marked "
"significant; other saturated models give an error."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid "Show contour (2D) or surface (3D) plots of the predicted response."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "doeAnalysis|"
msgid ""
